{"id":"vpravdu","lemma":"вправду","pos":"adv","rank":1561,"glosses":["really, indeed"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/50/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B4%D1%83.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B4%D1%83.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я вправду хочу пойти.","en":"I really want to go.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Мне вправду нужны деньги.","en":"I really need the money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283244","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null,{"g":"money"}]},{"text":"Ты и вправду можешь это есть?","en":"Could you actually eat this?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"there is / to eat"}]},{"text":"Сейчас вправду очень поздно.","en":"It really is quite late.","words":[{"g":"now"},null,{"g":"very"},{"g":"late"}]},{"text":"Мы вправду это ценим.","en":"We really appreciate it.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to appreciate","l":"ценить"}]}]}